b/sc8bsb.jpg"}, {"id": 388522, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8bsa.jpg"}, {"id": 388524, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8bsc.jpg"}], "slug": "blightbound", "storyline": "The world lies in peril. Decades ago, a band of legendary warriors slayed the dreaded Shadow Titan after a long and ferocious struggle, but their celebration was short-lived. The Shadow Titan\u2019s true intentions revealed themselves when from his broken husk flowed the Blight; a corrupting fog that alters any living creature exposed to its evil.", "summary": "Blightbound is a multiplayer dungeon crawler that tasks three heroes to venture down from their mountain refuge to face the abominations of the Blight - a mysterious and corrupting fog that enshrouds the land.\n\nExplore handcrafted dungeons, fight a terrifying cadre of mystical and monstrous enemies, grab valuable loot and recover fallen heroes to expand your roster of available warriors. Each player will fulfill a specific role on the team - warrior, assassin, or mage - to overcome colossal bosses and solve clever puzzles.\n\nCan you collect and complete all the challenges, and conquer the Blight once and for all?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/blightbound", "videos": [{"id": 52760, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "F68lfvzcv7U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F68lfvzcv7U", "title": "Blightbound - Coming to PS4, XB1, and PC on July 27", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F68lfvzcv7U/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 37196, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "D6Fu1uReqfU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D6Fu1uReqfU", "title": "Blightbound gameplay trailer | PC Gaming Show 2020", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D6Fu1uReqfU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 35969, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "b2GKhxVYELE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b2GKhxVYELE", "title": "Blightbound - Co